@startuml
title Create appointment (client booking)

actor Client
participant "NGINX" as NGINX
participant "FE (Next.js client)" as FE
participant "BE (Django/DRF)" as BE
database "DB (PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Worker (Procrastinate)" as Worker

== Browse availability ==
Client -> FE : pick staff + service + date
FE -> NGINX : GET /v1/availability/slots?staff_id&service_id&date
NGINX -> BE : proxy
note over BE
  availability.views.AvailableSlotsView (AllowAny)
  availability.services.generate_slots()
  - dynamic slots at booking_slot_minutes granularity
  - minus breaks, time-off, existing appointments
  - respects minimum_notice_hours
  Slots are NEVER stored (database.md).
end note
BE -> DB : SELECT schedules / breaks / time-off / appointments
BE --> FE : 200 {slots: [iso8601 UTC, ...]}

== Book a slot ==
Client -> FE : confirm booking (+ optional Nail Art)
FE -> NGINX : POST /v1/appointments  (X-CSRFToken)
NGINX -> BE : proxy
note over BE
  AuthN: session cookie; AuthZ: role = client
  appointments.serializers.AppointmentCreateSerializer
end note
BE -> BE : appointments.services.create_appointment()
note over BE
  Business rules (in order):
  - client not blacklisted
  - Nail Art only on nail services (+15 simple / +30 complex)
  - duration = per-client override or service default (+ nail art)
  - start_at: future, >= minimum_notice_hours, <= booking_horizon_days
  - lock staff row (select_for_update) to serialize bookings
  - idempotency_key short-circuit (return existing)
  - within working schedule, no break, no time-off
  - <= max_appointments_per_day / _per_week
  - no overlapping booked appointment
  - snapshot effective (discounted) price + duration (ADR 0001)
end note
BE -> DB : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (staff row)
BE -> DB : INSERT appointment (status=booked, auto-confirmed)
BE -> Worker : enqueue notifications.send_appointment_confirmation (defer)
BE --> FE : 201 Created (AppointmentSerializer)
FE --> Client : confirmation UI

== Confirmation (async) ==
Worker -> BE : run send_appointment_confirmation(appointment_id)
note over Worker
  notifications.services.send_appointment_confirmation_now
  - respects client's preferred channel (email/SMS)
  - deduped via NotificationLog.dedup_key (idempotent)
end note
@enduml
